,"t":"Kris Letang with a snapper that sounded like it hit off someone/thing and gets past Luukkonen to make it 2-2.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3n3dluilgu226"},{"a":"Matthew Fairburn","d":"2026-11-28T01:54:26+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"Kris Letang's shot through traffic beats Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen. Sabres and Penguins tied at 2. ","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3n3dluihno32z"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-28T01:31:48+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"Ben Kindel got a read on that bouncing puck in the slot and smoked it past Luukkonen to tie it up 1-1","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3n3dklzczak26"},{"a":"Matthew Fairburn","d":"2026-11-28T00:40:23+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen leads the Sabres onto the ice for warmups. ","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3n3dhq2wdda2o"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-28T00:39:44+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"Warmups? At this hour??\n\nIt's Sergei Murashov and \nUkko-Pekka Luukkonen leading their teams to the ice. Sabres and Penguins for this evening's matchup","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3n3dhovgaas2p"},{"a":"Heather Engel","d":"2026-11-28T00:39:44+00:00","h":"engelheather.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen leads the Sabres out for warmup. Sergei Murashov leads the way for the Penguins after Atley Calvert takes his solo lap ahead of his NHL debut.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/engelheather.bsky.social/post/3n3dhovqxys26"},{"a":"Heather Engel","d":"2026-11-27T15:34:54+00:00","h":"engelheather.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Sabres back at it, working off the turkey ahead of facing the Penguins.\n\nUkko-Pekka Luukkonen is in the starter’s net. Don’t see Zach Benson or Noah Östlund.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/engelheather.bsky.social/post/3n3cjaoizvk27"},{"a":"Heather Engel","d":"2026-11-26T01:43:44+00:00","h":"engelheather.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Gavrikov gets the Rangers on the board with 45.6 seconds left in the period. Shot from the middle of the blue line through traffic gets past a screened Luukkonen. 3-1 Sabres","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/engelheather.bsky.social/post/3n36kdipvgs2g"},{"a":"Matthew Fairburn","d":"2026-11-26T01:41:33+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"Rangers get one back with 45 seconds left in the second period. Point shot deflected. Luukkonen looked like he didn't see it. Sabres up 3-1. ","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3n36k7lvckt2i"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-26T01:41:31+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"Sabres guilty of messing around and being too loose with their play get punished for it after a shot from out high goes through a mass of humanity and into the net. Luukkonen couldn't even see where the shot was coming from.\n\n3-1 Sabres","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3n36k7k3pjc2y"},{"a":"Heather Engel","d":"2026-11-26T01:18:32+00:00","h":"engelheather.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Luukkonen with a big save on Max Sasson on a short-handed breakaway. \n\nHe comes up with another key stop soon after, this one at even strength, on J.T. Miller right in front after the Rangers had odd-man rush.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/engelheather.bsky.social/post/3n36iwgicu22g"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-26T01:18:06+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"That \"Luuuuuk\" chant could work for Luukkonen who had to make a slick save on the Rangers 2-on-1 or for Louis Crevier who laid out to help force a pass.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3n36ivo7cls2y"},{"a":"Matthew Fairburn","d":"2026-11-25T15:37:27+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen has the net to himself at the Sabres’ optional morning skate. Konsta Helenius out here in a regular jersey. Mattias Samuelsson is also skating. ","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3n35ihf6ikh24"}],"team":"BUF","threads":[{"d":"2026-11-12T02:22:18+00:00","sub":"hockey","t":"Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen casually drops his stick behind his net","u":"https://www.reddit.com/r/hockey/comments/1xu0ux2/ukkopekka_luukkonen_casually_drops_his_stick/"}],"videos":[{"d":"2026-11-26T03:46:47+00:00","id":"8Z-KKasBP74","k":"video","t":"\"We Are Finding Our Own Game Again And It Helps My Game Too\" | UPL on Team Success | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8Z-KKasBP74"},{"d":"2026-11-20T05:10:20+00:00","id":"RDTBpqBG5Mk","k":"video","t":"\"Just Want To Help The Team\" | Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen After 6-3 Win In Washington | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RDTBpqBG5Mk"},{"d":"2026-11-10T18:39:01+00:00","id":"PmDd_nWkAno","k":"video","t":"“You Can Learn From People Like Eddie”| Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen On Season & HFC | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PmDd_nWkAno"},{"d":"2026-11-01T00:22:57+00:00","id":"QNM7-YvzfwE","k":"video","t":"“You Go Through Everything As A Group” | Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen On Working Together | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QNM7-YvzfwE"}]}